## How to Focus to Stop Getting False Positives
If you try to test all of these at once using automated scanners, you will get overwhelmed with thousands of lines of useless logs (like the backtick results you showed earlier).
To actually find a high-paying bug, professional bug hunters pick just one target area at a time and test it manually. [4] 
